 million and trails badly in cash. Expert ratings mostly call the race Likely or Solid Republican, and prediction markets price Hill near an 80 percent favorite. Yet the only recent independent poll, from Hendrix College in mid-August, showed Jones ahead by four points among likely voters, and the race has drawn national attention, including endorsements and surrogate visits for Jones. The forecast treats the race as competitive but tilted to Hill, blending the district's lean and money advantage against the favorable recent polling for Jones.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1835, "margin": -5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.3532, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.3233, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2423, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2933, "margin": -3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1983, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.3205, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.3445, "margin": -3.0}]}